{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29029","headline":"郑侍御厅翫鹤 · 许浑","name":"郑侍御厅翫鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧天飞舞下晴莎，金阁瑶池绝网罗。\n岩响数声风满树，岸移孤影雪凌波。\n缑山去远云霄迥，辽海归迟岁月多。\n双翅一开千万里，秖应栖隐恋乔柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}